}



### 20. List all (expect data array, newest first, pagination.total = number of patients)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients

### 22. Search by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients?q=ngozi

### 23. Uppercase name still matches (case-insensitive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients?q=OKAFOR

### 24. Partial phone (expect Ngozi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients?q=0803

### 25. Phone typed with a space (expect Ngozi; spaces are stripped)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients?q=0803%20123

### 26. Card number, lowercase (expect all ANK patients)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients?q=ank-0000

### 27. NHIS number (expect Obiora only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients?q=NHIS-001

### 28. Pagination (expect 2 results, page 2, totalPages calculated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients?limit=2&page=2

### 29. Limit is capped at 50 (expect pagination.limit = 50, not 1000)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients?limit=1000

### 30. No match (expect data [] and total 0, still status 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients?q=zzzzzz

### 31. Garbage page value falls back to 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients?page=abc